<title>USA: Boston Communications signs AirTouch pact.</title>
<headline>Boston Communications signs AirTouch pact.</headline>
<dateline>WOBURN, Mass. 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boston Communications Group Inc said on Friday that it has signed a contract with AirTouch Cellular, a division of AirTouch Communications, to provide wireless prepaid calling services to AirTouch customers.</p>
<p>The services will begin initially in the Detroit and Sacramento regions and certain Ohio markets.</p>
</text>
